{
    "title": "Nurx - Healthcare & Rx at Home",
    "description": "<b>Get personalized healthcare from Nurx!</b> Receive prescriptions for birth control, acne treatment, rosacea and anti-aging, migraine care, PrEP for HIV prevention, herpes medicine and more \u2014 and home tests for STIs and HPV.\r\n\r\nThe Nurx app is one of the most convenient and affordable ways to take care of your personal healthcare needs. We deliver your treatment to your door, billing insurance if you have it and keeping things affordable if you don\u2019t. Our goal is to help you stay on top of your health in a way that\u2019s private, convenient, affordable and... just better.\r\n\r\nHOW IT WORKS\r\nShare your health history, at your convenience\ud83d\udc69\u200d\u2695\ufe0f\r\nNurx medical team reviews & prescribes, if appropriate\ud83d\udc8a\r\nWe deliver to your door for free, in discreet packaging\ud83d\udced\r\n \r\nWHAT IT COSTS\r\n\u2714We bill insurance for your medication or tests, and offer transparent pricing for those without insurance.\r\n\u2714Medication starting at $0 with insurance or $15/month without insurance.\r\n\u2714Save on transportation and time away from work. We provide care at your convenience and deliver for free.\r\n\r\nIN THE NEWS\r\n\"Nurx is like your sexual health fairy godmother.\" -InStyle\r\n\"A game-changer for birth control\"-ELLE\r\n\"These days, you can get just about anything delivered to your doorstep...and now you can get an at-home HPV screening kit.\"-Bustle\r\n\r\nBIRTH CONTROL\r\nGet a birth control prescription anytime, from anywhere. Our medical team prescribes online, then we deliver to your door, with automatic refills and free delivery. Choose from 50+ formulas\u2014pill, ring, patch, or shot.\r\n\r\nACNE, ROSACEA & ANTI AGING TREATMENT\r\nThe Nurx medical team provides personalized treatment for acne and rosacea, with prescription topical and/or oral treatments. We bill insurance (if you have it) for your medications, deliver them to your door, and provide ongoing care. We also prescribe retinoid cream to treat fine lines, wrinkles, uneven pigmentation and dark spots.\r\n\r\nHEADACHE & MIGRAINE TREATMENT\r\nConnect with specially trained medical providers for diagnosis and/or treatment of migraines and chronic headaches. Share your health history and submit a short video exam, then a provider will review and (if appropriate) write a treatment plan with prescriptions delivered. Migraine treatment includes one year of care, with follow-up assessments and prescription adjustments if needed.\r\n\r\nMENTAL HEALTH\r\nGet a personalized treatment plan for anxiety and depression medication, plus ongoing support on your schedule.\r\n\r\nHERPES TREATMENT\r\nWe prescribe and deliver the antiviral medication valacyclovir to people with oral or genital herpes who have already been diagnosed. We offer prescriptions for outbreaks or for daily prevention.\r\n\r\nSTI & HPV HOME TESTS\r\nOur home test kits let you test for sexually transmitted infections, or screen for cervical cancer. Depending on your test, a member of our medical team will be in touch to walk you through your results and prescribe treatment or connect you with care if needed.\r\n\r\nPREP FOR HIV PREVENTION\r\nNurx is the most convenient way to order PrEP. Do the required testing from home, no lab visit required. We make PrEP affordable by connecting you with payment assistance.\r\n\r\nEMERGENCY CONTRACEPTION\r\nThe morning-after pill prevents pregnancy when taken up to 5 days after sex. We'll help you get emergency contraception \u2014 Plan B or Ella \u2014 in the mail or fulfilled at a pharmacy near you.\r\n\r\nPRIVATE MESSAGING WITH TOP PROVIDERS\r\nEveryone on the Nurx medical team is certified and licensed. You'll receive judgment-free quality care, and as a patient you can message our medical team any time with questions about your medication or tests. Nurx is HIPAA-compliant.\r\n\r\nNurx is currently available in these states: AL, CA, CO, CT, FL, GA, KY, IA, ID, IL, IN, LA, MA, MD, ME, MI, MN, MO, MT, NJ, NY, NC, OH, OR, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WY and District of Columbia. Nurx is only available to people age 13 and older, depending on state law. Home tests not available in NY and herpes treatment not available in WA.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Get personalized healthcare from Nurx!</b> Receive prescriptions for birth control, acne treatment, rosacea and anti-aging, migraine care, PrEP for HIV prevention, herpes medicine and more \u2014 and home tests for STIs and HPV.<br><br>The Nurx app is one of the most convenient and affordable ways to take care of your personal healthcare needs. We deliver your treatment to your door, billing insurance if you have it and keeping things affordable if you don\u2019t. Our goal is to help you stay on top of your health in a way that\u2019s private, convenient, affordable and... just better.<br><br>HOW IT WORKS<br>Share your health history, at your convenience\ud83d\udc69\u200d\u2695\ufe0f<br>Nurx medical team reviews &amp; prescribes, if appropriate\ud83d\udc8a<br>We deliver to your door for free, in discreet packaging\ud83d\udced<br> <br>WHAT IT COSTS<br>\u2714We bill insurance for your medication or tests, and offer transparent pricing for those without insurance.<br>\u2714Medication starting at $0 with insurance or $15/month without insurance.<br>\u2714Save on transportation and time away from work. We provide care at your convenience and deliver for free.<br><br>IN THE NEWS<br>&quot;Nurx is like your sexual health fairy godmother.&quot; -InStyle<br>&quot;A game-changer for birth control&quot;-ELLE<br>&quot;These days, you can get just about anything delivered to your doorstep...and now you can get an at-home HPV screening kit.&quot;-Bustle<br><br>BIRTH CONTROL<br>Get a birth control prescription anytime, from anywhere. Our medical team prescribes online, then we deliver to your door, with automatic refills and free delivery. Choose from 50+ formulas\u2014pill, ring, patch, or shot.<br><br>ACNE, ROSACEA &amp; ANTI AGING TREATMENT<br>The Nurx medical team provides personalized treatment for acne and rosacea, with prescription topical and/or oral treatments. We bill insurance (if you have it) for your medications, deliver them to your door, and provide ongoing care. We also prescribe retinoid cream to treat fine lines, wrinkles, uneven pigmentation and dark spots.<br><br>HEADACHE &amp; MIGRAINE TREATMENT<br>Connect with specially trained medical providers for diagnosis and/or treatment of migraines and chronic headaches. Share your health history and submit a short video exam, then a provider will review and (if appropriate) write a treatment plan with prescriptions delivered. Migraine treatment includes one year of care, with follow-up assessments and prescription adjustments if needed.<br><br>MENTAL HEALTH<br>Get a personalized treatment plan for anxiety and depression medication, plus ongoing support on your schedule.<br><br>HERPES TREATMENT<br>We prescribe and deliver the antiviral medication valacyclovir to people with oral or genital herpes who have already been diagnosed. We offer prescriptions for outbreaks or for daily prevention.<br><br>STI &amp; HPV HOME TESTS<br>Our home test kits let you test for sexually transmitted infections, or screen for cervical cancer. Depending on your test, a member of our medical team will be in touch to walk you through your results and prescribe treatment or connect you with care if needed.<br><br>PREP FOR HIV PREVENTION<br>Nurx is the most convenient way to order PrEP. Do the required testing from home, no lab visit required. We make PrEP affordable by connecting you with payment assistance.<br><br>EMERGENCY CONTRACEPTION<br>The morning-after pill prevents pregnancy when taken up to 5 days after sex. We&#39;ll help you get emergency contraception \u2014 Plan B or Ella \u2014 in the mail or fulfilled at a pharmacy near you.<br><br>PRIVATE MESSAGING WITH TOP PROVIDERS<br>Everyone on the Nurx medical team is certified and licensed. You&#39;ll receive judgment-free quality care, and as a patient you can message our medical team any time with questions about your medication or tests. Nurx is HIPAA-compliant.<br><br>Nurx is currently available in these states: AL, CA, CO, CT, FL, GA, KY, IA, ID, IL, IN, LA, MA, MD, ME, MI, MN, MO, MT, NJ, NY, NC, OH, OR, PA, RI, SC, SD, TN, TX, UT, VA, WA, WI, WY and District of Columbia. Nurx is only available to people age 13 and older, depending on state law. Home tests not available in NY and herpes treatment not available in WA.",
